  I mean there's no more this is the  endgame yes this is the endgame this is  a policy that can deliver a win  a win means forcing the Taliban to  negotiate an end to the fighting and  Nicolson estimates it will take two  years for the new strategy to produce  results in the meantime topple will  remain a target for high-profile attacks  not just by the Taliban but by any of  the 21 terrorist groups that operate in  Afghanistan Gail all right David thank  you
 

